flowchart TD
    power([Power on]) --> init[Initialize the hardware]
    init --> read[Read the inputs]
    read --> safety[Check the E-stop and limit switches]
    safety --> start[Start button: clear the faults or restart the cycle]
    start --> fault{Fault latched?}
    fault -->|No| run[Run the cycle and move the axes]
    fault -->|Yes| safe[Safe state: stop the axes, hold the part]
    run --> report[Report the state over Modbus]
    safe --> report
    report -->|Next pass| read
